# stackguardian_runner_group (Resource)

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Running workflows on this group

A workflow opts in to a runner group through its `runner_constraints`:

```terraform
runner_constraints = {
  type  = "private"
  names = [stackguardian_runner_group.example.resource_name]
}
```

With `type = "shared"` the workflow uses StackGuardian's shared runners and `names` does not
apply.

## Log storage

`storage_backend_config` is where run logs are written, and it is separate from the credentials
a workflow deploys with. For `aws_s3` the runner authenticates through a
`stackguardian_connector` named in `integration_id`.

